# Basking Rootwalla's ability is an instant-speed activation: Bot1 pumps it on Bot2's turn 4 in response to Burst
# Lightning, which deals only 2 to the resulting 3/3 (a 1/1 would have died). The pump and the damage both end in
# cleanup, so on turn 5 it is a 1/1 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Basking Rootwalla
Forest x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Burst Lightning
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Basking Rootwalla.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Burst Lightning.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Toughness = 3
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Damage = 2
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Power = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Basking Rootwalla
